WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.589 --> 00:00:04.420
Just breathe...

00:00:09.309 --> 00:00:12.309
What do you see?

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:18.740
How do you keep something secret?

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:21.440
You hide it in plain sight.

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:29.110
Who hasn't had the impulse to put their life on hold for a moment, just vanish completely.

00:00:29.110 --> 00:00:32.800
And now if I'll ever see you again.

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:35.160
The plot thickens.

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:38.740
Our legacy isn't how many commas we have in our bank account.

00:00:38.740 --> 00:00:42.460
It's who we are lucky enough to have in our lives and what we can lead them with.

00:00:42.460 --> 00:00:45.840
It's time for the Jedi to end.

00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:56.780
I only know one truth.

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:03.580
I saw in you what someone once saw in me.

00:01:06.220 --> 00:01:11.320
Use whatever force is necessary to restore order.

